#AREA Rome~

#AUTHORS Atari~

#TEMPERATURE 30 40 5 5

#HELPS
-1 rome~
A lively city full with all kinds of different people and things to do.
Although there are rumors of a small group trying to kill the emperor,
the atmosphere is still kind and you can go take a look at the Coliseum.
~
-1 romeupdate~
area version in use is 1.45 final
~
-1 brutustells~
{130}Brutus says Hey, Come here quick.
{300}Brutus steps out of the shadows a little bit.
{130}Brutus tells you 'Here's all you need to do. Go to Caesar and tell him'
Brutus tells you 'I would like to talk to you in private for a moment.'
Brutus tells you 'after he leads you away, wait for further instructions.'
{300}As soon as he finishes his last words, Brutus steps back into the shadows.
~
0 $~

#RANGES 17 27 0 99

#MOBILES
#29000
roman citizen~
a Roman~
A citizen of rome is here.~
The citizen standing in front of you is in the
middle of his daily affairs. Whether it's making
a food and water run or just out to socialize.
~
ACT_BODY|ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_IS_NPC
0
0 S
30 BODY_HEAD BODY_HEAD 2d480+0 5d8+8
10000 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 15~
smile $r
~
>death_prog 5~
MPOLOAD 29000
~
|
#29001
roman kid~
the Roman kid~
A roman kid is here looking for treasure.~
The kid scours the ground for dropped coins and
other objects that catch his eye. Looks like
he's been at it for a while.
~
ACT_IS_NPC|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_DETECT_INVIS
0 S
30 BODY_HEAD BODY_HEAD 2d480+0 5d8+8
10000 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 10~
mpecho The Roman kid searches the ground beneath your feet for coins.
~
>give_prog i29000~
if sex($n) == 1
   say WOW! Thanks Mister!
   say I've been lookin' for one of these.
   say Well, all I've got to give you is this thing.
   say Hope it helps!
   MPOLOAD 29001
   drop i29001
else
if sex($n) == 2
   say WOW! Thanks Lady!
   say I've been lookin' for one of these.
   say Well, all I've got to give you is this thing.
   say Hope it helps!
   MPOLOAD 29001
   drop i29001
endif
endif
~
|
