#29003
poor citizen~
a poor citizen~
A poor citizen of the city walks about here.~
The citizen pretty much keeps to himself and
scavenges what he can from his resources. He
doesn't live in the best area of the town, but
he gets by.
~
ACT_BODY|ACT_SMART|ACT_RACE
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_TONGUES|AFF_UNDERSTAND
0 S
25 BODY_HEAD BODY_HEAD 1d1+439 3d6+9
10000 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>greet_prog 100~
if actorhasobjnum(29002)
   if quest(0,7,$n) == 0
      say Looks like you bought some junk from that store.
      say He'll never get any good items if he doesn't start
      say turning a profit.
      say Well, I guess the least I can do is fix it for you.
      say I'll need some good glue if you can find some.
      say Just bring it to me when you do.
      mpmset $n quest 0 7 1
   endif
endif
if actorhasobjnum(29003)
   if quest(0,7,$n) == 2
      say Looks like you found some glue.
      say Give me the junk you bought and the glue.
   endif
endif
~
>give_prog I29002~
if quest(0,7,$n) == 2
   say Ok, now give me the glue.
   MPMSET $n quest 0 7 3
   break
else
   if quest(0,7,$n) == 3
      say Ok, Here goes.
      MPECHO The poor citizen glues a few of the pieces of the junk together and plays with it for a minute.
      say Hey, good as new. Who woulda thought?
      MPJUNK i29002
      MPJUNK i29003
      MPOLOAD 29004
      give i29004 $n
      MPMSET $n quest 0 7 4
      break
   endif
endif
~
>give_prog I29003~
if quest(0,7,$n) == 2
   say Ok, now give me the junk.
   MPMSET $n quest 0 7 3
   break
else
if quest(0,7,$n) == 3
   say Ok, Here goes.
   MPECHO The poor citizen glues a few of the pieces of the junk together and plays with it for a minute.
   say Hey, good as new. Who woulda thought?
   MPJUNK i29002
   MPJUNK i29003
   MPOLOAD 29004
   give i29004 $n
   MPMSET $n quest 0 7 4
   break
endif
endif
~
|
