#29005
ethereal~
Ethereal Mob~
An ethereal mob is reading lines from a script.~
The ethereal mob holds the script to what brutus
and Cassius say b4 they kill caesar.
~
ACT_BODY|ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_ETHEREAL
0 S
25 BODY_HEAD BODY_HEAD 1d1+439 3d6+9
10000 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>rand_prog 80~
if pcsinroom (29006) == 1
   if quest(0,10,self) < 1
      mpmset self quest 0 10 1
   break
endif
endif
if quest(0,10,self) == 1
  mpecho From behind the doorway you can hear what sounds like two men arguing.
  mpmset self quest 0 10 2
  break
endif
if quest(0,10,self) == 2
  mpecho Man 1: 'I dunno..'
  mpecho Man 2: 'You have to help! This is the only way we can rid'
  mpecho Man 2: 'Rome of this tyranny.'
  mpmset self quest 0 10 3
  break
endif
if quest(0,10,self) == 3
  mpecho Man 1: 'But are you sure the only way to do this is murder Caesar?!'
  mpecho You tumble back as you hear the words murder Caesar.
  mpmset self quest 0 10 4
  break
endif
if quest(0,10,self) == 4
  mpecho Man 2: 'What was that?'
  mpecho Man 1: 'I don't know..'
  mpecho Man 1: 'GUARDS, CHECK OUTSIDE.'
  mpmset self quest 0 10 5
  break
endif
if quest(0,10,self) == 5
  mpecho Two guards emerge from the doorway and drag you into the room.
  mpmset $r quest 9 1 1
  mpforce $r east
  mpmset self quest 0 10 0
  break
endif
~
|
#29006
cassius~
Cassius~
Cassius is standing next to a small table.~
Cassius looks nervous about seeing you in here
and it doesn't help that he's a little nervy
about the plan he's helping undertake.
~
ACT_IS_NPC|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE|ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART
AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
0 S
30 BODY_HAND BODY_HAND 2d480+0 5d8+8
5000 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>greet_prog 100~
if quest(9,1,$n) == 1
say Hrmm.. What to do with you..
say You must have heard our conversation.
say Therefore you must befriend us or join Caesar in
say the pits of Hell.
say Are you going to join us?
else
say INTRUDER! GET OUT!
mptransfer $n 29005
endif
~
>speech_prog yes~
say Good!
say My name is Cassius and this man is Brutus.
mpecho Brutus Nods to you.
say Now we must get you affiliated with Caesar.
say You must earn his trust if you are to inflict
say the killing blow on him.
say Since Brutus knows him well, he will be able to
say get you close enough to talk to him and hopefully
say earn his friendship.
say Brutus will tell Caesar you are coming.
mpecho Brutus leaves the room and you are escorted out.
mpmset $n quest 0 7 7
mptransfer $n 29023
~
>speech_prog no~
say Bah! To the pits with you then.
mptransfer $n 29008
~
