#29008
caesar~
Caesar~
Caesar, emperor of Rome is here.~
A dignified man garbed in pure white robes. He is
obviously a man of high standards and authority.
~
ACT_IS_NPC|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE|ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART
AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES|AFF_SANCTUARY
0 S
40 BODY_FOOT BODY_FOOT 10d100+200 5d10+3
20000 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>speech_prog p Hey Caesar man, reset me.~
say Sure dude.
MPMSET $n quest 0 7 0
say All done. Have fun.
~
>greet_prog 100~
if quest(0,7,$n) == 7
   say Welcome. I'm guessing you're the foreigner Brutus
   say was talking about.
   say Before you talk to me, you must defeat three beasts
   say in the Coliseum just south of here. I enjoy a good
   say fight, and if you do well, I expect to see you back
   say here. I cannot be reduced to knowing anyone who
   say cannot defend themselves.
   say Now get going. I'll tell the arena master you're
   say going to be there to fight.
   mpecho The guards escort you out of the palace at a wave of Caesar's hand.
   mpmset $n quest 0 7 8
   mptransfer $n 29056
else
if quest(0,7,$n) == 10
   say Ah, very good $n.
   say I would never have guessed you could put on such
   say a good show. You've definitely earned a bit of my
   say time, my friend. Please come back so we can talk
   say later.
   say I believe Brutus said he wanted a word with you.
   say He's should be around the palace somewhere.
   mpmset $n quest 0 7 11
else
if quest(0,7,$n) == 12
   say Welcome back $n.
   say I've been waiting for you to return.
   say There's a lot I'd like to talk to you about.
endif
endif
endif
~
>speech_prog p I would like to talk to you in private for a moment.~
if quest(0,7,$n) == 12
   mpecho Caesar leads you down to a hallway and into a private room.
   mptransfer $n 29107
   mpgoto 29107
   say Ok, we're alone.
   say Now what did you want to talk about?
   mpmset self quest 0 2 1
endif
~
>rand_prog 80~
if quest(0,2,self) == 1
   mpecho Brutus shouts 'KILL HIM NOW!'
   mpecho Caesar gives you a confused look.
   tell $n You treacherous fool.
   mpkill $n
   mpmset self quest 0 2 0
  else
  if quest(7,1,self) == 1
    if pcsinroom (29107) == 0
      mpmset self quest 7 1 0
      mpgoto 29060
    endif
  endif
endif
~
>fight_prog 100~
if quest(7,1,self) == 0
   mpmset self quest 7 1 1
endif
~
>death_prog 100~
if quest(0,7,$n) == 12
   say Et tu, $n?
   say I endow you with my bloodied garments so you
   say may not forget the injustice you have done
   say to all of Rome.
   mpquiet ON
   cast 'giant strength' $n
   mpquiet OFF
   mpoload 29005
   mpoload 29006
   mpoload 29007
   mpoload 29008
   give i29005 $n
   give i29006 $n
   give i29007 $n
   give i29008 $n
   mpmload 29009
   mpecho A guard arrives briskly.
   mpmset $n quest 0 7 13
endif
~
|
