#ROOMS
#29000
The sewer tunnel~
You've made your way into a small sewer tunnel lined with rats and various
other rodents and insects. The smell down here is awful, and there's no
telling what kind of diseases you could be afflicted by down here. Looks
like your clothes are going to need a lot of washing after you get out
of here.
~
290 ROOM_DARK|ROOM_NO_MOB SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_UP
~
~
